    "turn_text": "right by all the people chiming in and a couple times you chimed in and people liked here in your perspective. So, but yeah, tell us what made you want to start Tianan. Well, Tianan came to life because I had a following that when I left the radio show to get the president elected, they all wanted a little more of the motivation. They wanted to know what was going on in my life, where I was going, what was happening. And so my producer, Paul, decided that Tianan, We really should have a weekly show, call it TNN, Tana's News Network, where we tell the truth. We don't sugarcoat anything. We don't hide anything. And we're going to be just highlighting what's going on in the world, what's going on in my life, what's going on in the President's life, and tell the truth. And highlighting great people like you who had an idea and I infused a little love and energy into you and said, you can do it, Caleb. And now you're doing it. And it's those stories that TNN is all about love and motivation and highlighting great American's dreams that I can help make come true. And so it's just a platform that we have every Thursday night on Facebook where we turn on the camera and I talk about great things that are happening and just sort of bring light into this world that wants to be nasty and ugly and mean.",
